description: "Log in to the application with valid credentials"
tags: [login, authentication]
author: "Laurent Eschenauer"
created: "2025-03-31"

Task:
  Navigate to ${HOSTNAME}.
  Log in with username ${USERNAME} and password ${PASSWORD}.
  Verify that the dashboard page is displayed.
  Ask the question 'what is the weather forecast for Liège tomorrow ?' and press the submit button.
  Wait for an answer and verify it seems a correct answer.
  Logout from the application with the last icon on the right.
  Verify that you are back to the login screen.
